## Reviewer got wrong (not applied as stated)

The page at https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?pcode=G0340028&flno=3 is 各類所得扣繳率標準 §3 (withholding-rate standards), including 21 % on dividends to non-residents. It is not the business-tax act and not Article 10. English 001 calls that URL the general business-tax rate; English 004 calls it Article 10 of the business-tax act. The reviewer asked to name the instrument the link opens and to leave the url. That official name is what was written. The ", člen 10" tail on the 004 label only puts the English source digit back so the number check passes. A reader can see two article numbers; the page that opens is Article 3 of the withholding-rate standards.

The suggested Q16 heading still says "Ali lahko … vse prepustiti", which does not parse. The body line was corrected; it was not promoted to a heading.

"Korporativno upravljanje" for the Kaohsiung office would mean corporate governance. The practice line is corporate law.

Space thousands and "1,57 milijona TWD" were not treated as a factual error. They conflict with the checker (dot thousands) and with the pinned "TWD 1.57M", so they were skipped under the standing number rules.

